{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1135465,\"title\":\"We Work for the Dead\",\"tagline\":\"We work for the dead.\",\"overview\":\"Magnus has a side hustle. He drives for The Night Mail, which isn't a bad gig, if you don't mind being possessed. What is the Night Mail? A delivery service with a dark secret - working for the dead.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rH6VneQdritY752DTZpGlpeGxJV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yuo3Uy75sV3z8ZTdHXeN85Jl0Dv.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2024,\"runtime\":85,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Joanne Reay\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":136143,\"name\":\"Joanne Reay\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kDBPKgSc71kygzgwW51cJKlq546.jpg\"},{\"id\":136141,\"name\":\"Andrew Goth\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iDeeG4GaJTinXgFB4tGfqDTI0Ur.jpg\"},{\"id\":12094,\"name\":\"Jennifer Saunders\",\"character\":\"The Mother (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pTgxwHcz9L8SNVYvPJS0o0lgHya.jpg\"},{\"id\":11275,\"name\":\"Stephen Fry\",\"character\":\"Pruitt (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dH7GuUZ8QPM9RN99ak9KKOkSkdS.jpg\"},{\"id\":26209,\"name\":\"Matt Lucas\",\"character\":\"Perry (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2OhGLJqiknaWlbTkG2KDwT935km.jpg\"},{\"id\":1780975,\"name\":\"Assad Zaman\",\"character\":\"Lot\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rKrmK8xK9wdf7Wy1HNS4ltnRTE.jpg\"},{\"id\":3901867,\"name\":\"Lucas Jones\",\"character\":\"Donny\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zVq1eZLzwQptRUDmqzyYhgx6WbQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":136141,\"name\":\"Andrew Goth\",\"character\":\"Walker\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iDeeG4GaJTinXgFB4tGfqDTI0Ur.jpg\"},{\"id\":4094643,\"name\":\"Scarlet Billham\",\"character\":\"Honey\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1627084,\"name\":\"Eva Bradley-Williams\",\"character\":\"Aimee\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ajJgTAgZhh3N9wpcjN19QN0ctEj.jpg\"},{\"id\":4087869,\"name\":\"Rhys Bailey\",\"character\":\"Red Triker\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eXVv1oJMuxv7Zu5WEhW2AjNtykR.jpg\"},{\"id\":4094644,\"name\":\"Charlotte C Carroll\",\"character\":\"Trisha\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5650213,\"name\":\"Mark Gillham\",\"character\":\"Juke\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2922780,\"name\":\"Rachel Laurence\",\"character\":\"Audrey\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1756705,\"name\":\"Karren Winchester\",\"character\":\"Margaret\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eCQzQiPiOgNvqbzDjRrMFI0mMm1.jpg\"},{\"id\":2136611,\"name\":\"David J. Keogh\",\"character\":\"Wayne\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5645925,\"name\":\"Emma Lo\",\"character\":\"Jade\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":83533,\"title\":\"Avatar: Fire and Ash\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bRBeSHfGHwkEpImlhxPmOcUsaeg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u8DU5fkLoM5tTRukzPC31oGPxaQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the wake of the devastating war against the RDA and the loss of their eldest son, Jake Sully and Neytiri face a new threat on Pandora: the Ash People, a violent and power-hungry Na'vi tribe led by the ruthless Varang. Jake's family must fight for their survival and the future of Pandora in a conflict that pushes them to their emotional and physical limits.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":454639,\"title\":\"Masters of the Universe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oRuyGUHdoaQxWP3SDfafGkStxTC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5MUMB3aPEPEQPCIAaygXFUTWE9Y.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After being separated for 15 years, the Sword of Power leads Prince Adam back to Eternia, where he discovers his home shattered under the fiendish rule of Skeletor. To save his family and his world, Adam must join forces with his closest allies, Teela and Duncan/Man-At-Arms, and embrace his true destiny as He-Man — the most powerful man in the universe.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":246655,\"title\":\"X-Men: Apocalypse\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ikA8UhYdTGpqbatFa93nIf6noSr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sTQNRqLbfCXolrb5CizAW1dj528.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the re-emergence of the world's first mutant, world-destroyer Apocalypse, the X-Men must unite to defeat his extinction level plan.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9738,\"title\":\"Fantastic Four\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4YMcYEFS8sFuW3soP1HVmgR3cSm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qq9ELjoyllBUMkGisZvcj0fCd43.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a space voyage, four scientists are altered by cosmic rays: Reed Richards gains the ability to stretch his body; Sue Storm can become invisible; Johnny Storm controls fire; and Ben Grimm is turned into a super-strong … thing. Together, these \\\"Fantastic Four\\\" must now thwart the evil plans of Dr. Doom and save the world from certain destruction.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9016,\"title\":\"Treasure Planet\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kNhZkR3UNbXfvESQo7mJpOi4tGd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f2opsSUSiMdEp6AiY2sbC8QPd8S.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When space galleon cabin boy Jim Hawkins discovers a map to an intergalactic \\\"loot of a thousand worlds,\\\" a cyborg cook named John Silver teaches him to battle supernovas and space storms on their journey to find treasure.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1159831,\"title\":\"The Bride!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lV8YHwGkYZsm6EfIqnhaSz2avKt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uXgWbwxmCW6XZ3ylRThk9Sqhwwq.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A lonely Frankenstein travels to 1930s Chicago to ask groundbreaking scientist Dr. Euphronious to create a companion for him. The two revive a murdered young woman and The Bride is born. But what ensues is beyond what either of them imagined.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":76757,\"title\":\"Jupiter Ascending\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xzQ25m9vrdyvpLX74T3B3KB40Ou.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w4hk4QG05nDuSgimpa7XAM6OyPX.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a universe where human genetic material is the most precious commodity, an impoverished young Earth woman becomes the key to strategic maneuvers and internal strife within a powerful dynasty…\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":228161,\"title\":\"Home\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/usFenYnk6mr8C62dB1MoAfSWMGR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gnkBzJVH2zicIopP2fHf4kRElne.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Earth is taken over by the overly-confident Boov, an alien race in search of a new place to call home, all humans are promptly relocated, while all Boov get busy reorganizing the planet. But when one resourceful girl, Tip, manages to avoid capture, she finds herself the accidental accomplice of a banished Boov named Oh. The two fugitives realize there’s a lot more at stake than intergalactic relations as they embark on the road trip of a lifetime.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":268896,\"title\":\"Pacific Rim: Uprising\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nFWhttU8PM50t25NPdy7PE7rv3G.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oMaj75G2WFw66xI1TREg1hrToSg.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It has been ten years since The Battle of the Breach and the oceans are still, but restless. Vindicated by the victory at the Breach, the Jaeger program has evolved into the most powerful global defense force in human history. The PPDC now calls upon the best and brightest to rise up and become the next generation of heroes when the Kaiju threat returns.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":526896,\"title\":\"Morbius\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Av8Z2jZhEm1FLkFzMThzz9hndJF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jzWT0zd8U77fqWg5WgUfYaMzSFz.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Dangerously ill with a rare blood disorder, and determined to save others suffering his same fate, Dr. Michael Morbius attempts a desperate gamble. What at first appears to be a radical success soon reveals itself to be a remedy potentially worse than the disease.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8698,\"title\":\"The League of Extraordinary Gentlemen\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kdAuVFP63XXxnb983ry2pLCKd9S.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n3VpgjdOB1DkHSUe1DbFzV8ncpJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"To prevent a world war from breaking out, famous characters from Victorian literature band together to do battle against a cunning villain.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":353491,\"title\":\"The Dark Tower\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i9GUSgddIqrroubiLsvvMRYyRy0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pVVobDO8cezhVPvwD6EBUN0g3mt.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A boy haunted by visions of a parallel world aids its disillusioned guardian in preventing the destruction of the nexus of universes known as the Dark Tower.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"ayAGJh8-MW0\",\"name\":\"WE WORK FOR THE DEAD Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}